  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Mixed. The washing is still there. I wash my hands around thirty times a day, down from about fifty in the autumn.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:21",
      "end_timestamp": "00:34",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thirty is still a lot. Walk me through what a typical day looks like.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:35",
      "end_timestamp": "00:42",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Every time I touch a door handle, a keyboard, anything from outside, I feel contaminated, and I can't settle until I've washed.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:44",
      "end_timestamp": "00:58",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Is the anxious feeling worse when you try not to wash?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:59",
      "end_timestamp": "01:06",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Much worse. I feel anxious when I can't wash, like something terrible is about to happen. It builds until I give in.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:07",
      "end_timestamp": "01:18",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And your hands, how are they?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:19",
      "end_timestamp": "01:23",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Sore. They crack and bleed in the winter. I've been using more cream.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:25",
      "end_timestamp": "01:31",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Let's go through the tablets. What are you on right now?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:33",
      "end_timestamp": "01:40",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Fluoxetine, 40 mg once a day in the morning. Then a small white tablet that the clinic added in the summer, I couldn't tell you the name, only that it's round with a line through it.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:41",
      "end_timestamp": "02:01",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, I'll look it up on your record, but for now I'll note that you can't name it. And the third?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:02",
      "end_timestamp": "02:13",
      "supports": [
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Melatonin, 2 mg at night, when my mind won't switch off.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:14",
      "end_timestamp": "02:20",
      "supports": [
        "medications[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. Any thoughts of harming yourself?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:22",
      "end_timestamp": "02:26",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No. None at all. It's the opposite, I'm frightened of germs, not of dying.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:28",
      "end_timestamp": "02:36",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thank you for being direct. What's your background, health-wise?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:37",
      "end_timestamp": "02:42",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "OCD, diagnosed six years ago. And I've had eczema since I was little.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:44",
      "end_timestamp": "02:52",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Do you work at the moment?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:53",
      "end_timestamp": "02:57",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, I work as a librarian. Handling books is fine, it's the returns bin I dread.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:58",
      "end_timestamp": "03:07",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Pulse 70, blood pressure 122 over 76, temperature 36.4, oxygen 99 percent. And weight 61 kilos, which matches last time.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:25",
      "end_timestamp": "03:35",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]",
        "vital_signs[2]",
        "vital_signs[3]",
        "vital_signs[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Dry, cracked skin across both knuckles, with a split here on the right.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:03",
      "end_timestamp": "04:10",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I can't rule out the eczema flaring on top of the washing, which would explain some of the soreness.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:16",
      "end_timestamp": "04:26",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's excellent. Keep going with those, and use a thick emollient straight after each wash rather than waiting.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:00",
      "end_timestamp": "05:11",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to check your blood, a routine blood test, to make sure nothing physical is adding to your anxiety.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:22",
      "end_timestamp": "05:33",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Come back in six weeks, and bring the log again.",
